{"path":"container/queue/push_range","title":"std::queue<T,Container>::push_range","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::queue&lt;T,Container&gt;::</span>push_range","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/queue/push_range","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Inserts a copy of each element of rg in queue, as if by:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to\"><span class=\"kw100\">container-compatible-range</span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>value_type<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> R <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> push_range<span class=\"br0\">(</span> R<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> rg <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Inserts a copy of each element of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> in <code>queue</code>, as if by:\n</p>\n<ul><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">append_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/forward\"><span class=\"kw1125\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>R<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> if that is a valid expression (i.e. the underlying container <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c</span></code> has an appropriate <code>append_range</code> member function), or\n</li><li> <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/copy\"><span class=\"kw2868\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">copy</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg, <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/back_inserter\"><span class=\"kw670\">std::<span class=\"me2\">back_inserter</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> otherwise.\n</li></ul>\n<p><br>\nEach iterator in the range <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">rg</span></code> is dereferenced exactly once.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> rg\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">container compatible range</a>, that is, an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><code>input_range</code></a> whose elements are convertible to <code>T</code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Identical to the complexity of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">c.<span class=\"me1\">append_range</span></span></code> or <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/copy\"><span class=\"kw2868\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">copy</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg, <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/back_inserter\"><span class=\"kw670\">std::<span class=\"me2\">back_inserter</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> (depending on what function is used internally).\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable ftm-begin ftm-has-value\">\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/feature_test\">Feature-test</a> macro</th>\n<th><abbr>Value</abbr></th>\n<th><abbr>Std</abbr></th>\n<th>Feature\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/feature_test#cpp_lib_containers_ranges\"><code>__cpp_lib_containers_ranges</code></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/compiler_support/23#cpp_lib_containers_ranges_202202L\"><code>202202L</code></a></td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark\">(C++23)</span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/to#container_compatible_range\">Ranges-aware</a> construction and insertion\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;algorithm&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;queue&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> Adaptor<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\nrequires <span class=\"br0\">(</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/input_range\"><span class=\"kw2920\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">input_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> Adaptor<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">container_type</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Adaptor<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> adaptor<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Container <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> Adaptor <span class=\"co1\">// gain access to protected Adaptor::Container c;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> container<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> this<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>c<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> elem <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Container<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>adaptor<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">container</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> elem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/queue\"><span class=\"kw1306\">std::<span class=\"me2\">queue</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> adaptor<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rg <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co2\">#ifdef __cpp_lib_containers_ranges</span>\n    adaptor.<span class=\"me1\">push_range</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#else</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/algorithm/ranges/for_each\"><span class=\"kw3007\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">for_each</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>rg, <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>adaptor<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> e<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span> adaptor.<span class=\"me1\">push</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>e<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#endif</span>\n&nbsp;\n    println<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, adaptor<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1 3 2 4</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/queue/push\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  inserts element at the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/queue","title":"std::queue"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::queue<T,Container>::push_range","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++23. Inserts a copy of each element of rg in queue, as if by:"},{"label":"Parameters","note":"rg"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Identical to the complexity of c.append_range or ranges::copy(rg, std::back_inserter(c)) (depending on what function is used internally)."},{"label":"Notes"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push","note":"inserts element at the end"}]}]},"standards":["C++23"],"wordCount":205,"codeBlockCount":2}
